		'Calculate minimum, base and maximum from the bandwidth of the selected limiter (5 %% but at least 1 Mbit/s / 100 %% / 100 %%, upload base 50 %%)' => 'Minimum, Basis und Maximum aus der Bandbreite des gewählten Limiters berechnen (5 %%, mindestens 1 Mbit/s / 100 %% / 100 %%, Upload-Basis 50 %%)',
